  - profile `new`: <HOME>/rice/new/hypr/hyprland.lua is a Lua config, which nothing can check before a login (NOT-POSSIBLE.md#verify-lua-config)
  - profile `old`: <HOME>/rice/old/hypr/hyprland.lua is a Lua config, which nothing can check before a login (NOT-POSSIBLE.md#verify-lua-config)
  - profile `old`: no manifest has been recorded for it yet, so its tree was not compared with anything
  - running theme daemons (/proc) and snapper's configuration (/etc/snapper) were not checked: this is the test sandbox (D56)

